# Instrument: max qty 10, band 10% around the configured reference 100.
L 1 10 1000 100
# Defaults for every account: notional 1000, position 15, credit 2000, 3 open orders.
A 2 * 1000 15 2000 3 - -
N 3 1 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 11
# 11% above the reference.
N 4 2 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 111 1
# Notional exactly 1000, then 1010.
N 5 3 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 10
N 6 4 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 101 10
# Exactly on the band edge; worst-case position +15.
N 7 5 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 90 5
N 8 6 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 90 1
# Open notional 1450 + 545 = 1995; third open order.
N 9 7 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 109 5
N 10 8 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 108 1
# The cancel frees a slot and 545 of credit: 1450 + 654 > 2000, 1450 + 545 fits.
C 11 7
N 12 9 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 109 6
N 13 10 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 109 5
